   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Global Donor Platform Rual dev</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Donor platform Rual dev</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Donor platform rual development is a donor platform with members among donors and international organisations. the platform was established in the beginning of 2000. The objective is to increase the visibility and support to agriculture and food security in development cooperation. There is a small secretariat based at GIZ. Sweden contributes to the platform and is a member of the board.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Global Donor platform rual development &#xE4;r en givarplattform med b&#xE5;de betalande och observerande medlemmar som bildades i b&#xF6;rjan av 2000-taket. Dess syfte &#xE4;r att lyfta fr&#xE5;gan och synligg&#xF6;ra jordbruk och livsmedelstrygghet inom utvecklingssamarbetet. Ett litet sekretariat ligger placerat p&#xE5; GIZ och Sverige som betalande medlem har en plats i styrelsen i platformen.</narrative>
  </description>
